<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Configuración</title>
<!-- Mockup de la pestaña Configuración (skin "Papel"). Enmienda v3.1 (decisiones-tomadas.md §J–§K):
     jerarquía editable supermetas/metas con lápiz que reabre el panel de creación (mover/color/nombre),
     cuestionario obligatorio al crear supermeta (calendario → color, default: el del calendario),
     mínimo una meta por supermeta (altiro abre su creación), plazos (máx. 1 año), confirmación al
     eliminar (eliminar supermeta mata sus metas), gestión de calendarios (crear/eliminar con
     confirmación). LAS CATEGORÍAS NO EXISTEN (§K1). Claves localStorage compartidas con cronómetro
     y galaxia (productvt-supermetas-v1, productvt-capas-v1). -->
<style>
  :root{
    --paper: #EFEDE5; --paper-raised: #FAF9F3; --ink: #20241E; --muted: #6E7368;
    --accent: #3A6B54; --accent-ink: #F3F7F1; --accent-soft: #DCE6DC;
    --rule: #D5D1C1; --rule-strong: #B9B4A0; --danger: #9C4A3A; --danger-soft: #E9D6CF;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){
    :root:not([data-theme="light"]){
      --paper: #14170F; --paper-raised: #1B1F16; --ink: #E9E7DC; --muted: #949A88;
      --accent: #7BB596; --accent-ink: #10241A; --accent-soft: #223429;
      --rule: #2B3225; --rule-strong: #3C4433; --danger: #D08871; --danger-soft: #33221D;
    }
  }
  :root[data-theme="dark"]{
    --paper: #14170F; --paper-raised: #1B1F16; --ink: #E9E7DC; --muted: #949A88;
    --accent: #7BB596; --accent-ink: #10241A; --accent-soft: #223429;
    --rule: #2B3225; --rule-strong: #3C4433; --danger: #D08871; --danger-soft: #33221D;
  }
  *{ box-sizing: border-box; }
  body{
    margin: 0; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink);
    font-family: "Archivo", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  button{ font: inherit; cursor: pointer; }
  input, select{ font: inherit; }
  .shell{ max-width: 420px; margin: 0 auto; min-height: 100vh; padding: 0 0 28px; }
  .topbar{ display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; padding: 18px 20px 6px; }
  .topbar h1{ margin: 0; font-family: "Fraunces", Georgia, serif; font-weight: 500; font-size: 22px; }
  .topbar .sub{ font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }
  .section{ margin: 14px 16px 0; border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--paper-raised); overflow: hidden; }
  .section > h2{
    margin: 0; padding: 12px 14px 10px; font-family: "Fraunces", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 500; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
  }
  .section > h2 .hint{ font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 400; }
  .section .body{ padding: 12px 14px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
  .row{ display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; }
  .glabel{ font-size: 13.5px; }
  .glabel small{ display: block; color: var(--muted); font-size: 11.5px; margin-top: 2px; }
  .mini-btn{
    border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong); background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink);
    border-radius: 8px; padding: 5px 10px; font-size: 12px;
  }
  .mini-btn.danger{ color: var(--danger); border-color: var(--danger); }
  .mini-btn.xs{ padding: 3px 8px; font-size: 11px; }
  .form{ display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 9px; border: 1px dashed var(--rule-strong); border-radius: 10px; padding: 11px; background: var(--paper); }
  .form input, .form select, .form textarea{
    background: var(--paper-raised); color: var(--ink); border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong);
    border-radius: 8px; padding: 8px 10px; font-size: 13.5px; width: 100%;
  }
  .form textarea{ font-family: inherit; resize: vertical; min-height: 52px; }
  .form label{ font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--muted); display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .palette{ display: flex; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .palette button{ width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid transparent; padding: 0; }
  .palette button[aria-pressed="true"]{ border-color: var(--ink); }
  .toggle{
    width: 44px; height: 26px; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong);
    background: var(--paper); position: relative; padding: 0; flex: none;
  }
  .toggle .knob{
    position: absolute; top: 2px; left: 2px; width: 20px; height: 20px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--muted); transition: left .18s ease, background .18s ease;
  }
  .toggle[aria-pressed="true"]{ background: var(--accent-soft); border-color: var(--accent); }
  .toggle[aria-pressed="true"] .knob{ left: 21px; background: var(--accent); }
  .phrase{
    font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.5; padding: 10px 12px;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--danger); background: var(--danger-soft); border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
  }
  .phrase input{ width: 100%; background: var(--paper-raised); color: var(--ink); border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong); border-radius: 8px; padding: 8px 10px; font-size: 13px; }
  .note{ margin: 14px 16px 0; font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.5; }
  .save-toast{
    position: fixed; left: 50%; bottom: 18px; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(80px);
    background: var(--accent); color: var(--accent-ink); font-size: 12.5px;
    padding: 9px 16px; border-radius: 20px; transition: transform .25s ease; pointer-events: none;
  }
  .save-toast.show{ transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); }
  .hidden{ display: none !important; }
  /* ---- Calendarios (v3.1 §J6, §K2) ---- */
  .cal-row{ display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 6px 0; border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--rule); }
  .cal-row:last-child{ border-bottom: none; }
  .cal-row .sw{ width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; flex: none; }
  .cal-row .name{ flex: 1; font-size: 13px; }
  .cal-row .linked{ font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted); }

  /* ---- Jerarquía (v3.1 §J1–J5) ---- */
  .tree{ display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
  .sg-node{ border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 10px; background: var(--paper); padding: 9px 10px; }
  .sg-row{ display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
  .sg-row .planet{ width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 50%; flex: none; box-shadow: inset -3px -3px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.18); }
  .sg-row .name{ font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; flex: 1; }
  .sg-row .meta-tag{
    font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 9.5px; color: var(--muted);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong); border-radius: 10px; padding: 1px 7px; flex: none;
  }
  .sg-row .anti-tag{
    font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 9.5px; color: var(--danger);
    border: 1px solid var(--danger); border-radius: 10px; padding: 1px 7px; flex: none;
  }
  .goal-row{ display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 6px 0 0 22px; }
  .goal-row .moon{ width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; flex: none; }
  .goal-row .name{ font-size: 12.5px; flex: 1; }
  .goal-row .pct{ font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 10px; color: var(--accent); flex: none; }
  .goal-row .dl{ font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 9.5px; color: var(--muted); flex: none; }
  .goal-row input{ font-size: 12.5px; background: var(--paper-raised); color: var(--ink); border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong); border-radius: 6px; padding: 3px 7px; width: 120px; }
  .add-goal-row{ display: flex; gap: 6px; padding: 7px 0 0 22px; }
  .anti-hint{ font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.45; margin-top: 6px; }
  .tools{ display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center; }
  /* ---- Botones de icono (lápiz / eliminar) · v3.1 §J4–J5 ---- */
  .icon-btn{
    border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong); background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink);
    border-radius: 6px; width: 26px; height: 24px; font-size: 11.5px; line-height: 1;
    padding: 0; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: none;
  }
  .icon-btn.danger{ color: var(--danger); border-color: var(--danger); }
  .sg-row .tools, .goal-row .tools{ display: flex; gap: 4px; flex: none; }
  .inline-hint{ font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.45; }
  /* ---- Confirmación obligatoria al eliminar · v3.1 §J5/§K4 ---- */
  .confirm{
    position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(20,23,15,.45);
    display: none; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 22px; z-index: 40;
  }
  .confirm.open{ display: flex; }
  .confirm .box{
    background: var(--paper-raised); border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong);
    border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; max-width: 320px; width: 100%;
  }
  .confirm p{ margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; }
  .confirm .row{ display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 8px; }
  .mini-btn.danger-solid{ background: var(--danger); color: #F7EFEC; border-color: var(--danger); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="shell">
  <div class="topbar">
    <h1>Configuración</h1>
    <span class="sub">cambios guardados al instante</span>
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Calendarios <span class="hint">capas del calendario · v3.1 §J6</span></h2>
    <div class="body">
      <div id="calList"></div>
      <div class="form hidden" id="newCalForm">
        <div><label>Nombre del calendario</label><input type="text" id="calName" maxlength="24" placeholder="p. ej. Universidad"></div>
        <div><label>Color</label><div class="palette" id="calPalette"></div></div>
        <div class="row">
          <button class="mini-btn" id="calCancel" type="button">Cancelar</button>
          <button class="mini-btn" id="calSave" type="button">Crear</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <button class="mini-btn" id="newCalBtn" type="button" style="align-self:flex-start">+ Nuevo calendario</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Jerarquía <span class="hint">supermetas → metas · v3.1 §J</span></h2>
    <div class="body">
      <div class="tree" id="hierarchyTree"></div>
      <button class="mini-btn" id="newSuperBtn" type="button" style="align-self:flex-start">+ Nueva supermeta</button>

      <div class="form hidden" id="superForm">
        <div><label>Nombre de la supermeta</label><input type="text" id="sfName" maxlength="28" placeholder="p. ej. Título"></div>
        <div>
          <label>¿Pertenece a un calendario existente? (v3.1 §J1)</label>
          <select id="sfCalendar"></select>
        </div>
        <div>
          <label>Color (default: el del calendario elegido)</label>
          <div class="palette" id="sfPalette"></div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <label>Plazo de cumplimiento (v3.1 §I6 · máx. 1 año)</label>
          <input type="datetime-local" id="sfDeadline">
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="glabel">Es antimeta<small>sin puntaje; solo eventos atemporales (v3 §A7)</small></div>
          <button class="toggle" id="sfAnti" aria-pressed="false" type="button"><span class="knob"></span></button>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <button class="mini-btn" id="sfCancel" type="button">Cancelar</button>
          <button class="mini-btn" id="sfSave" type="button">Crear</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="form hidden" id="goalForm">
        <div>
          <label>Supermeta a la que pertenece (v3.1 §J2)</label>
          <select id="gfSuper"></select>
        </div>
        <div><label>Nombre de la meta</label><input type="text" id="gfName" maxlength="40" placeholder="p. ej. Ramo 1"></div>
        <div>
          <label>Color (etiqueta de supermeta + color del bloque en el calendario, v3.1 §K3)</label>
          <div class="palette" id="gfPalette"></div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <label>Plazo de cumplimiento (v3.1 §I6 · máx. 1 año)</label>
          <input type="datetime-local" id="gfDeadline">
        </div>
        <div>
          <label>Tareas iniciales (una por línea — base del % de cumplimiento, v3.1 §I7)</label>
          <textarea id="gfTasks" placeholder="Leer capítulo 1&#10;Ejercicios 1–10"></textarea>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <button class="mini-btn" id="gfCancel" type="button">Cancelar</button>
          <button class="mini-btn" id="gfSave" type="button">Crear</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="anti-hint">Crear una supermeta obliga a asociarle como mínimo una meta: al crearla, altiro se abre el formulario de meta dentro de ella (v3.1 §J3). Eliminar una supermeta <strong>mata todas sus metas</strong> — siempre con confirmación (v3.1 §J5). El lápiz reabre el panel de creación para mover, recolorear o renombrar (v3.1 §J4).</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Sonidos</h2>
    <div class="body">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="glabel">Campana al terminar bloque<small>suena cuando el bloque de estudio llega a cero</small></div>
        <button class="toggle" id="sndBell" aria-pressed="true" type="button"><span class="knob"></span></button>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="glabel">Alarma de «toca estudiar»<small>avisa cuando el descanso terminó</small></div>
        <button class="toggle" id="sndAlarm" aria-pressed="true" type="button"><span class="knob"></span></button>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="glabel">Tic-tac en pantalla<small>feedback visual del conteo (sin audio)</small></div>
        <button class="toggle" id="sndTick" aria-pressed="false" type="button"><span class="knob"></span></button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Frase de cancelación</h2>
    <div class="body">
      <div class="phrase" id="phraseView">
        <span id="phraseText"></span>
        <div class="row" style="margin-top:8px">
          <button class="mini-btn" id="phraseEdit" type="button">Editar</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="phrase hidden" id="phraseEditBox">
        <input type="text" id="phraseInput" maxlength="120">
        <div class="row" style="margin-top:8px">
          <button class="mini-btn" id="phraseCancel" type="button">Cancelar</button>
          <button class="mini-btn" id="phraseSave" type="button">Guardar</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <span style="font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted)">Se muestra en el panel de doble confirmación antes de cancelar la sesión.</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <p class="note"><strong>Las categorías no existen</strong> (v3.1 §K1): todo se gestiona en metas y supermetas. Los calendarios funcionan aparte: pueden tener una o más supermetas conectadas y crear eventos propios (con el sistema de 3 colores) o eventos invisibles, que solo existen dentro del calendario (v3.1 §K5). Cuenta y sincronización: Firebase (plan Spark).</p>
</div>
<div class="save-toast" id="toast">Guardado</div>

<!-- Confirmación obligatoria al eliminar (v3.1 §J5/§K4) -->
<div class="confirm" id="confirmBox">
  <div class="box">
    <p id="confirmText"></p>
    <div class="row">
      <button class="mini-btn" id="confirmNo" type="button">Cancelar</button>
      <button class="mini-btn danger-solid" id="confirmYes" type="button">Eliminar</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<script>
(function(){
  var SUPER_KEY = "productvt-supermetas-v1";
  var CAL_KEY = "productvt-capas-v1";       // misma clave que usa calendario.html (allí se llaman "capas")
  var PALETTE = ["#3A6B54","#2E7B84","#B9812E","#6B8F71","#8C5A7A","#C0672B","#4A6FA5","#9C4A3A"];
  var YEAR_MS = 365 * 24 * 3600 * 1000;     // v3.1 §I6: plazo máximo

  function loadJSON(key, fallback){
    try{ var raw = localStorage.getItem(key); return raw ? JSON.parse(raw) : fallback; }catch(e){ return fallback; }
  }
  function saveJSON(key, val){ try{ localStorage.setItem(key, JSON.stringify(val)); }catch(e){} }
  function esc(s){
    return String(s).replace(/[&<>"']/g, function(c){ return {"&":"&amp;","<":"&lt;",">":"&gt;",'"':"&quot;","'":"&#39;"}[c]; });
  }
  function uid(p){ return p + Date.now().toString(36) + Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 5); }
  function fmtDeadline(iso){
    if(!iso) return "";
    var d = new Date(iso);
    return d.toLocaleDateString("es", { day: "numeric", month: "short", year: "2-digit" });
  }

  // ---- Calendarios (misma fuente que calendario.html, v3.1 §J6/§K2) ----
  var CALENDARIOS = loadJSON(CAL_KEY, [{ id: "cap-uni", name: "Universidad", color: "#4E6E8E" }]);
  function calById(id){ return CALENDARIOS.filter(function(c){ return c.id === id; })[0] || null; }

  // ---- Supermetas y metas (modelo v3.1, con migración desde el modelo v3) ----
  function migrateSg(s){
    s.calendarId = s.calendarId !== undefined ? s.calendarId : (s.calendar ? "__named__:" + s.calendar : null);
    if(s.calendarId && String(s.calendarId).indexOf("__named__:") === 0){
      var c = CALENDARIOS.filter(function(x){ return x.name === String(s.calendarId).slice(9); })[0];
      s.calendarId = c ? c.id : null;
    }
    delete s.calendar;
    if(s.deadline === undefined) s.deadline = null;
    s.goals = (s.goals || []).map(function(g){
      if(typeof g === "string") g = { name: g }; // modelo v3: metas como texto plano
      g.id = g.id || uid("g");
      g.color = g.color || s.color || PALETTE[0];
      if(g.deadline === undefined) g.deadline = null;
      g.tareas = (g.tareas || []).map(function(t){
        if(typeof t === "string") t = { name: t, done: false };
        return { id: t.id || uid("t"), name: t.name, done: !!t.done };
      });
      g.eventos = g.eventos || [];
      return g;
    });
    return s;
  }
  var DEFAULT_SG = [
    { id: "sg-titulo", name: "Título", color: "#4E6E8E", anti: false, calendarId: "cap-uni",
      deadline: new Date(Date.now() + 300 * 864e5).toISOString(),
      goals: [
        { id: "g-ramo1", name: "Ramo 1", color: "#3A6B54", deadline: new Date(Date.now() + 90 * 864e5).toISOString(),
          tareas: [ { name: "Leer capítulo 1", done: true }, { name: "Ejercicios 1–10", done: false }, { name: "Control 1", done: false } ],
          eventos: [ { id: "e-certamen", name: "Certamen 1", when: "fecha definida" } ] },
        { id: "g-proyecto", name: "Proyecto", color: "#2E7B84", deadline: new Date(Date.now() + 120 * 864e5).toISOString(),
          tareas: [ { name: "Escribir informe", done: false } ],
          eventos: [ { id: "e-entrega", name: "Entrega", when: "fecha definida" } ] }
      ] },
    { id: "sg-tesis", name: "Tesis", color: "#B9812E", anti: false, calendarId: null,
      deadline: new Date(Date.now() + 360 * 864e5).toISOString(),
      goals: [
        { id: "g-cap2", name: "Capítulo 2", color: "#8C5A7A", deadline: new Date(Date.now() + 60 * 864e5).toISOString(),
          tareas: [ { name: "Borrador", done: false }, { name: "Revisión", done: false } ],
          eventos: [ { id: "e-profesor", name: "Reunión con profesor", when: "atemporal" } ] }
      ] },
    { id: "antimeta", name: "Antimeta", color: "#9C4A3A", anti: true, calendarId: null, deadline: null, goals: [] }
  ];
  var SUPERMETAS = loadJSON(SUPER_KEY, DEFAULT_SG.slice()).map(migrateSg);
  function saveSupermetas(){ saveJSON(SUPER_KEY, SUPERMETAS); }
  function sgById(id){ return SUPERMETAS.filter(function(s){ return s.id === id; })[0] || null; }
  function goalPct(g){
    if(!g.tareas.length) return 0;
    return Math.round(g.tareas.filter(function(t){ return t.done; }).length / g.tareas.length * 100);
  }
  function sgPct(sg){
    var all = [];
    sg.goals.forEach(function(g){ all = all.concat(g.tareas); });
    if(!all.length) return 0;
    return Math.round(all.filter(function(t){ return t.done; }).length / all.length * 100);
  }

  // ---- Paleta reutilizable (v3.1 §J1–J2) ----
  function buildPalette(container, color, onSelect){
    container.innerHTML = "";
    PALETTE.forEach(function(col){
      var b = document.createElement("button");
      b.type = "button";
      b.style.background = col;
      b.setAttribute("aria-pressed", col === color ? "true" : "false");
      b.addEventListener("click", function(){ onSelect(col); });
      container.appendChild(b);
    });
  }

  // ---- Plazos: máx. 1 año, mín. 1 segundo (v3.1 §I6) ----
  function toLocalInput(ms){
    var d = new Date(ms), p = function(n){ return (n < 10 ? "0" : "") + n; };
    return d.getFullYear() + "-" + p(d.getMonth() + 1) + "-" + p(d.getDate()) + "T" + p(d.getHours()) + ":" + p(d.getMinutes());
  }
  function clampDeadline(input){
    if(!input.value) return null;
    var t = new Date(input.value).getTime();
    if(isNaN(t)) return null;
    var max = Date.now() + YEAR_MS, min = Date.now() + 1000;
    if(t > max) t = max;
    if(t < min) t = min;
    input.value = toLocalInput(t);
    return new Date(t).toISOString();
  }

  // ---- Confirmación obligatoria al eliminar (v3.1 §J5, §K4) ----
  var confirmBox = document.getElementById("confirmBox");
  var confirmText = document.getElementById("confirmText");
  var confirmYes = document.getElementById("confirmYes");
  var confirmNo = document.getElementById("confirmNo");
  var pendingAction = null;
  function askConfirm(msg, label, fn){
    confirmText.textContent = msg;
    confirmYes.textContent = label || "Eliminar";
    pendingAction = fn;
    confirmBox.classList.add("open");
  }
  function closeConfirm(){ confirmBox.classList.remove("open"); pendingAction = null; }
  confirmNo.addEventListener("click", closeConfirm);
  confirmBox.addEventListener("click", function(e){ if(e.target === confirmBox) closeConfirm(); });
  confirmYes.addEventListener("click", function(){ var fn = pendingAction; closeConfirm(); if(fn) fn(); });

  var toast = document.getElementById("toast"), toastTimer = null;
  function saved(){
    toast.classList.add("show");
    clearTimeout(toastTimer);
    toastTimer = setTimeout(function(){ toast.classList.remove("show"); }, 1400);
  }

  // ---- Calendarios: crear / eliminar (v3.1 §J6, §K2) ----
  var calListEl = document.getElementById("calList");
  var newCalForm = document.getElementById("newCalForm");
  var calState = { color: PALETTE[0] };
  function linkedSgs(calId){
    return SUPERMETAS.filter(function(s){ return s.calendarId === calId; });
  }
  function renderCalendars(){
    calListEl.innerHTML = "";
    if(!CALENDARIOS.length){
      var empty = document.createElement("span");
      empty.className = "inline-hint";
      empty.textContent = "Sin calendarios. Crea el primero abajo.";
      calListEl.appendChild(empty);
    }
    CALENDARIOS.forEach(function(c){
      var n = linkedSgs(c.id).length;
      var row = document.createElement("div");
      row.className = "cal-row";
      row.innerHTML =
        '<span class="sw" style="background:' + esc(c.color) + '"></span>' +
        '<span class="name">' + esc(c.name) + '</span>' +
        '<span class="linked">' + (n ? n + " supermeta" + (n > 1 ? "s" : "") : "sin vínculos") + '</span>';
      var del = document.createElement("button");
      del.className = "mini-btn xs danger";
      del.type = "button";
      del.textContent = "Eliminar";
      del.addEventListener("click", function(){
        askConfirm("¿Eliminar el calendario «" + c.name + "»? Las supermetas vinculadas quedarán sin calendario.", "Eliminar", function(){
          CALENDARIOS = CALENDARIOS.filter(function(x){ return x.id !== c.id; });
          SUPERMETAS.forEach(function(s){ if(s.calendarId === c.id) s.calendarId = null; });
          saveJSON(CAL_KEY, CALENDARIOS);
          saveSupermetas();
          renderCalendars();
          renderTree();
          saved();
        });
      });
      row.appendChild(del);
      calListEl.appendChild(row);
    });
  }
  function wirePalette(container, state, key){
    buildPalette(container, state[key], function(col){
      state[key] = col;
      wirePalette(container, state, key);
    });
  }
  wirePalette(document.getElementById("calPalette"), calState, "color");
  document.getElementById("newCalBtn").addEventListener("click", function(){
    newCalForm.classList.toggle("hidden");
    if(!newCalForm.classList.contains("hidden")) document.getElementById("calName").focus();
  });
  document.getElementById("calCancel").addEventListener("click", function(){
    newCalForm.classList.add("hidden");
    document.getElementById("calName").value = "";
  });
  document.getElementById("calSave").addEventListener("click", function(){
    var name = document.getElementById("calName").value.trim();
    if(!name) return;
    CALENDARIOS.push({ id: uid("cal"), name: name, color: calState.color });
    saveJSON(CAL_KEY, CALENDARIOS);
    document.getElementById("calName").value = "";
    newCalForm.classList.add("hidden");
    renderCalendars();
    fillCalendarOptions();
    saved();
  });
// ---- Árbol de jerarquía: supermetas → metas (v3.1 §J1–J5, §J7) ----
  var treeEl = document.getElementById("hierarchyTree");
  function iconBtn(label, title, cls, onClick){
    var b = document.createElement("button");
    b.className = "icon-btn" + (cls ? " " + cls : "");
    b.type = "button";
    b.textContent = label;
    b.title = title;
    b.addEventListener("click", onClick);
    return b;
  }
  function tag(text, color){
    var t = document.createElement("span");
    t.className = "meta-tag";
    t.textContent = text;
    if(color){ t.style.borderColor = color; t.style.color = color; }
    return t;
  }
  function renderTree(){
    treeEl.innerHTML = "";
    if(!SUPERMETAS.length){
      var empty = document.createElement("span");
      empty.className = "inline-hint";
      empty.textContent = "Sin supermetas. Crea la primera abajo.";
      treeEl.appendChild(empty);
      return;
    }
    SUPERMETAS.forEach(function(sg){
      var cal = sg.calendarId ? calById(sg.calendarId) : null;
      var node = document.createElement("div");
      node.className = "sg-node";

      var head = document.createElement("div");
      head.className = "sg-row";
      var planet = document.createElement("span");
      planet.className = "planet";
      planet.style.background = sg.color;
      head.appendChild(planet);

      var nm = document.createElement("span");
      nm.className = "name";
      nm.textContent = sg.name;
      head.appendChild(nm);

      if(sg.anti) head.appendChild(tag("antimeta"));
      else {
        var pt = tag(sgPct(sg) + "%");
        pt.style.borderColor = "var(--accent)";
        pt.style.color = "var(--accent)";
        head.appendChild(pt);
      }
      head.appendChild(cal ? tag(cal.name, cal.color) : tag("sin calendario"));
      if(sg.deadline) head.appendChild(tag(fmtDeadline(sg.deadline)));

      var tools = document.createElement("div");
      tools.className = "tools";
      if(!sg.anti){
        tools.appendChild(iconBtn("+", "Añadir una meta dentro de esta supermeta", "", function(){
          openGoalForm(null, sg.id, true);
        }));
      }
      tools.appendChild(iconBtn("✎", "Editar: renombrar, recolorear, plazo o calendario (§J4)", "", function(){
        openSuperForm(sg);
      }));
      tools.appendChild(iconBtn("✕", "Eliminar esta supermeta", "danger", function(){
        askConfirm(
          sg.goals.length
            ? "¿Eliminar «" + sg.name + "»? Esta supermeta mata sus " + sg.goals.length + " meta(s) y todo su progreso."
            : "¿Eliminar «" + sg.name + "»?",
          "Eliminar", function(){
            SUPERMETAS = SUPERMETAS.filter(function(x){ return x.id !== sg.id; });
            saveSupermetas();
            renderTree(); renderCalendars();
            saved();
          });
      }));
      head.appendChild(tools);
      node.appendChild(head);

      sg.goals.forEach(function(g){
        var row = document.createElement("div");
        row.className = "goal-row";
        var moon = document.createElement("span");
        moon.className = "moon";
        moon.style.background = g.color;
        row.appendChild(moon);

        var gname = document.createElement("span");
        gname.className = "name";
        gname.textContent = g.name;
        row.appendChild(gname);

        var gpct = tag(goalPct(g) + "%");
        gpct.style.borderColor = "var(--accent)";
        gpct.style.color = "var(--accent)";
        row.appendChild(gpct);

        if(g.deadline){
          var gdl = tag(fmtDeadline(g.deadline));
          row.appendChild(gdl);
        }

        var gtools = document.createElement("div");
        gtools.className = "tools";
        gtools.appendChild(iconBtn("✎", "Editar meta: mover a otra supermeta, color, nombre, plazo (§J7)", "", function(){
          openGoalForm(g, null, false);
        }));
        gtools.appendChild(iconBtn("✕", "Eliminar esta meta", "danger", function(){
          askConfirm("¿Eliminar la meta «" + g.name + "» de «" + sg.name + "»?", "Eliminar", function(){
            sg.goals = sg.goals.filter(function(x){ return x.id !== g.id; });
            saveSupermetas();
            renderTree(); renderCalendars();
            saved();
          });
        }));
        row.appendChild(gtools);
        node.appendChild(row);
      });

      treeEl.appendChild(node);
    });
  }
// ---- Formularios de supermeta y meta (v3.1 §J1–J3, §J7, §K3) ----
  var superForm = document.getElementById("superForm");
  var goalForm = document.getElementById("goalForm");
  var sfState = { color: PALETTE[0], anti: false, editing: null };
  var gfState = { color: PALETTE[0], editing: null };

  fillCalendarOptions();
  fillSuperOptions();
  wirePalette(document.getElementById("sfPalette"), sfState, "color");
  wirePalette(document.getElementById("gfPalette"), gfState, "color");

  function fillCalendarOptions(){
    var sel = document.getElementById("sfCalendar");
    var cur = sel.value;
    sel.innerHTML = "";
    var none = document.createElement("option");
    none.value = "";
    none.textContent = "No — sin calendario (se crea uno propio con su nombre)";
    sel.appendChild(none);
    CALENDARIOS.forEach(function(c){
      var o = document.createElement("option");
      o.value = c.id;
      o.textContent = "Sí — " + c.name;
      sel.appendChild(o);
    });
    sel.value = cur && calById(cur) ? cur : "";
  }
  function fillSuperOptions(){
    var sel = document.getElementById("gfSuper");
    var cur = sel.value;
    sel.innerHTML = "";
    var valid = SUPERMETAS.filter(function(s){ return !s.anti; });
    if(!valid.length){
      var o = document.createElement("option");
      o.value = "";
      o.textContent = "Sin supermetas disponibles (crea una primero)";
      sel.appendChild(o);
      return;
    }
    valid.forEach(function(s){
      var o = document.createElement("option");
      o.value = s.id;
      o.textContent = s.name;
      sel.appendChild(o);
    });
    sel.value = cur && valid.filter(function(s){ return s.id === cur; }).length ? cur : valid[0].id;
  }

  function openSuperForm(sg){
    sfState.editing = sg ? sg.id : null;
    sfState.color = sg ? sg.color : (CALENDARIOS[0] ? CALENDARIOS[0].color : PALETTE[0]);
    sfState.anti = sg ? !!sg.anti : false;
    fillCalendarOptions();
    document.getElementById("sfCalendar").value = sg && sg.calendarId ? sg.calendarId : "";
    document.getElementById("sfName").value = sg ? sg.name : "";
    document.getElementById("sfDeadline").value =
      (sg && sg.deadline) ? toLocalInput(new Date(sg.deadline).getTime()) : "";
    document.getElementById("sfAnti").setAttribute("aria-pressed", sfState.anti ? "true" : "false");
    wirePalette(document.getElementById("sfPalette"), sfState, "color");
    goalForm.classList.add("hidden");
    superForm.classList.remove("hidden");
    document.getElementById("sfSave").textContent = sg ? "Guardar cambios" : "Crear y añadir su primera meta";
    try{ superForm.scrollIntoView({ behavior: "smooth", block: "center" }); }catch(e){}
  }
// El color por defecto al asociar un calendario es el del calendario (v3.1 §J1)
  document.getElementById("sfCalendar").addEventListener("change", function(){
    var c = calById(this.value);
    if(c){
      sfState.color = c.color;
      wirePalette(document.getElementById("sfPalette"), sfState, "color");
    }
  });
  document.getElementById("sfAnti").addEventListener("click", function(){
    sfState.anti = !sfState.anti;
    this.setAttribute("aria-pressed", sfState.anti ? "true" : "false");
  });
  document.getElementById("newSuperBtn").addEventListener("click", function(){
    openSuperForm(null);
    document.getElementById("sfName").focus();
  });
  document.getElementById("sfCancel").addEventListener("click", function(){
    sfState.editing = null;
    superForm.classList.add("hidden");
  });
  document.getElementById("sfSave").addEventListener("click", function(){
    var nameEl = document.getElementById("sfName");
    var name = nameEl.value.trim();
    if(!name){ nameEl.focus(); return; }
    var calId = document.getElementById("sfCalendar").value || null;
    var deadline = clampDeadline(document.getElementById("sfDeadline"));
    var anti = sfState.anti;

    if(sfState.editing){
      var sg = sgById(sfState.editing);
      if(!sg) return;
      var apply = function(){
        sg.name = name;
        sg.calendarId = calId;
        sg.color = sfState.color;
        sg.deadline = deadline;
        sg.anti = anti;
        if(anti) sg.goals = []; // la antimeta no da puntaje ni tiene metas internas (v3 §A7)
        saveSupermetas();
        superForm.classList.add("hidden");
        sfState.editing = null;
        renderTree(); renderCalendars();
        saved();
      };
      if(anti && sg.goals.length){
        askConfirm("«" + sg.name + "» pasará a ser antimeta: pierde sus " + sg.goals.length +
          " meta(s) y su progreso. ¿Continuar?", "Convertir", apply);
      } else { apply(); }
      return;
    }

    var created = {
      id: uid("sg"), name: name, color: sfState.color, anti: anti,
      calendarId: calId, deadline: deadline, goals: []
    };
    SUPERMETAS.push(created);
    saveSupermetas();
    superForm.classList.add("hidden");
    renderTree(); renderCalendars();
    saved();
    // v3.1 §J3: crear supermeta obliga a asociarle al menos una meta → altiro se abre su creación
    openGoalForm(null, created.id, true);
  });

  function openGoalForm(g, superId, fixedSuper){
    gfState.editing = g ? g.id : null;
    gfState.color = g ? g.color : PALETTE[0];
    fillSuperOptions();
    var sel = document.getElementById("gfSuper");
    if(superId) sel.value = superId;
    if(g){
      var owner = SUPERMETAS.filter(function(s){
        return s.goals.some(function(x){ return x.id === g.id; });
      })[0];
      if(owner) sel.value = owner.id;
    }
    sel.disabled = !!fixedSuper && !g;
    document.getElementById("gfName").value = g ? g.name : "";
    document.getElementById("gfDeadline").value =
      (g && g.deadline) ? toLocalInput(new Date(g.deadline).getTime()) : "";
    document.getElementById("gfTasks").value =
      g ? g.tareas.map(function(t){ return t.name; }).join("\n") : "";
    wirePalette(document.getElementById("gfPalette"), gfState, "color");
    superForm.classList.add("hidden");
    goalForm.classList.remove("hidden");
    document.getElementById("gfSave").textContent = g ? "Guardar cambios" : "Crear meta";
    try{ goalForm.scrollIntoView({ behavior: "smooth", block: "center" }); }catch(e){}
  }
document.getElementById("gfCancel").addEventListener("click", function(){
    gfState.editing = null;
    goalForm.classList.add("hidden");
  });
  document.getElementById("gfSave").addEventListener("click", function(){
    var nameEl = document.getElementById("gfName");
    var name = nameEl.value.trim();
    if(!name){ nameEl.focus(); return; }
    var target = sgById(document.getElementById("gfSuper").value);
    if(!target){ fillSuperOptions(); return; }
    var deadline = clampDeadline(document.getElementById("gfDeadline"));
    var names = document.getElementById("gfTasks").value
      .split("\n").map(function(s){ return s.trim(); }).filter(Boolean);

    if(gfState.editing){
      var found = null, owner = null;
      SUPERMETAS.forEach(function(s){
        s.goals.forEach(function(x){ if(x.id === gfState.editing){ found = x; owner = s; } });
      });
      if(!found) return;
      found.name = name;
      found.color = gfState.color;
      found.deadline = deadline;
      found.tareas = names.map(function(n){
        var prev = found.tareas.filter(function(t){ return t.name === n; })[0];
        return { id: prev ? prev.id : uid("t"), name: n, done: prev ? prev.done : false };
      });
      // Mover la meta a otra supermeta (v3.1 §J7)
      if(owner && owner.id !== target.id){
        owner.goals = owner.goals.filter(function(x){ return x.id !== found.id; });
        target.goals.push(found);
      }
      saveSupermetas();
      goalForm.classList.add("hidden");
      gfState.editing = null;
      renderTree(); renderCalendars();
      saved();
      return;
    }

    target.goals.push({
      id: uid("g"), name: name, color: gfState.color, deadline: deadline,
      tareas: names.map(function(n){ return { id: uid("t"), name: n, done: false }; }),
      eventos: []
    });
    saveSupermetas();
    goalForm.classList.add("hidden");
    renderTree(); renderCalendars();
    saved();
  });
// ---- Frase de cancelación (doble confirmación) ----
  var phraseText = document.getElementById("phraseText");
  var savedPhrase = loadJSON("productvt-cancel-phrase", "");
  phraseText.textContent = typeof savedPhrase === "string" && savedPhrase
    ? savedPhrase : "¿Seguro que quieres cancelar el bloque?";
  document.getElementById("phraseEdit").addEventListener("click", function(){
    document.getElementById("phraseInput").value = phraseText.textContent;
    document.getElementById("phraseView").classList.add("hidden");
    document.getElementById("phraseEditBox").classList.remove("hidden");
  });
  document.getElementById("phraseCancel").addEventListener("click", function(){
    document.getElementById("phraseEditBox").classList.add("hidden");
    document.getElementById("phraseView").classList.remove("hidden");
  });
  document.getElementById("phraseSave").addEventListener("click", function(){
    var v = document.getElementById("phraseInput").value.trim();
    if(!v) return;
    phraseText.textContent = v;
    saveJSON("productvt-cancel-phrase", v);
    document.getElementById("phraseEditBox").classList.add("hidden");
    document.getElementById("phraseView").classList.remove("hidden");
    saved();
  });

  // ---- Arranque ----
  renderCalendars();
  renderTree();
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
</file>

<file path="01-mockups/mobile/galaxia-v2.html">
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Constelación de Metas v2</title>
<!-- Mockup interactivo de la galaxia — enmienda v3 §E (decisiones-tomadas.md).
     Comportamiento: solo supermetas (planetas) y metas (mini-planetas con enlaces,
     sensación tipo Obsidian Graph View §E1–E2); proporción considerable con metas
     como estrellas desde la vista general (§E3); orden circular por creación en
     sentido horario con "Restablecer" (§E4); arrastre libre y acomodo coordinado
     al soltar, empujando a las demás (§E5); vista de foco a pantalla completa con
     el planeta ocupando la mitad de la pantalla (§E6); posiciones persistidas en
     localStorage salvo reseteo (§E7); antimetas ocultas con botón (§E8); HUD
     decorativo (§F2) y botón crear como hotkey (§E9). -->
<style>
  :root{
    --paper: #EFEDE5; --paper-raised: #FAF9F3; --ink: #20241E; --muted: #6E7368;
    --accent: #3A6B54; --accent-ink: #F3F7F1; --accent-soft: #DCE6DC;
    --rule: #D5D1C1; --rule-strong: #B9B4A0; --danger: #9C4A3A;
    --hud-bg: #16213F; --hud-bg-2: #223462; --hud-ink: #F3F1E7;
    --cr-gold: #FFB627;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){
    :root:not([data-theme="light"]){
      --paper: #14170F; --paper-raised: #1B1F16; --ink: #E9E7DC; --muted: #949A88;
      --accent: #7BB596; --accent-ink: #10241A; --accent-soft: #223429;
      --rule: #2B3225; --rule-strong: #3C4433; --danger: #D08871;
    }
  }
  *{ box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body{ height: 100%; margin: 0; overflow: hidden; }
  body{
    background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink);
    font-family: "Archivo", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  button{ font: inherit; cursor: pointer; }
  .hud{
    position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 20;
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 12px 14px; pointer-events: none;
  }
  .hud > *{ pointer-events: auto; }
  .pill{
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;
    font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;
    border: 2px solid var(--hud-bg-2); background: var(--hud-bg); border-radius: 9px;
    padding: 6px 12px 6px 8px; color: var(--hud-ink); box-shadow: 0 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.25);
  }
  .pill.streak{ color: #FF8A5C; }
  .pill.currency{ color: var(--cr-gold); }
  .hud .spacer{ flex: 1; }
  .icon-btn{
    width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid var(--hud-bg-2); background: var(--hud-bg);
    color: var(--hud-ink); font-size: 15px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.25);
  }
  .hud-tool{
    font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 11px;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong); background: var(--paper-raised); color: var(--ink);
    border-radius: 8px; padding: 6px 10px;
  }
  .hud-tool[aria-pressed="true"]{ border-color: var(--accent); background: var(--accent-soft); color: var(--accent); }
  .fab{
    position: fixed; right: 16px; bottom: 16px; z-index: 20;
    width: 52px; height: 52px; border-radius: 50%; border: none;
    background: var(--accent); color: var(--accent-ink); font-size: 26px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.3);
  }
  .hint-line{
    position: fixed; left: 50%; bottom: 14px; transform: translateX(-50%);
    font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); background: var(--paper-raised);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 12px; padding: 5px 12px; z-index: 20; max-width: 92%; text-align: center;
  }
  body.focus .hint-line{ display: none; }
  #stage{ position: fixed; inset: 0; }
  #links{ position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; pointer-events: none; }
  #links line{ stroke: var(--rule-strong); stroke-width: 1; opacity: .6; }
  .planet{
    position: absolute; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    cursor: grab; touch-action: none; user-select: none; -webkit-user-select: none;
    box-shadow: inset -8px -8px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.18), 0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.22);
  }
  .planet.dragging{ cursor: grabbing; box-shadow: inset -8px -8px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.18), 0 10px 26px rgba(0,0,0,.35); z-index: 10; }
  .planet .pl-label{
    position: absolute; top: calc(100% + 6px); left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
    font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--ink); white-space: nowrap;
    padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 8px; pointer-events: none;
    background: var(--paper-raised); border: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .planet.anti{ border: 2px dashed var(--danger); box-shadow: none; }
  .planet.anti .pl-label{ color: var(--danger); }
  .moon{
    position: absolute; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--muted);
    width: 9px; height: 9px; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.25);
    animation: pulse 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  .moon .mn-label{
    position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 100%; transform: translateX(-50%);
    font-size: 9px; color: var(--muted); white-space: nowrap; display: none;
  }
  body.focus .moon{ width: 16px; height: 16px; background: var(--ink); }
  body.focus .moon .mn-label{ display: block; }
  .go-back{ position: fixed; top: 12px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); z-index: 20; display: none; }
  body.focus .go-back{ display: inline-flex; }
  @keyframes pulse{ 0%,100%{ opacity: .75; } 50%{ opacity: 1; } }
  /* ---- §I8: cabecera de la vista de supermeta (nombre editable + % + config) ---- */
  .focus-head{
    position: fixed; top: 50px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); z-index: 21;
    display: none; align-items: center; gap: 7px; max-width: 94%;
    background: var(--paper-raised); border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong);
    border-radius: 12px; padding: 7px 10px;
  }
  body.focus .focus-head{ display: flex; }
  .focus-head .fname{ font-family: "Fraunces", Georgia, serif; font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 500; }
  .focus-head .fpct{
    font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent); flex: none;
  }
  .focus-head input{
    font: inherit; font-size: 15px; width: 132px; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong); border-radius: 7px; padding: 3px 7px;
  }
  .mini-btn{
    border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong); background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink);
    border-radius: 8px; padding: 5px 9px; font-size: 12px;
  }
  .icon-mini{
    border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong); background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink);
    border-radius: 6px; width: 26px; height: 24px; font-size: 11.5px; line-height: 1;
    padding: 0; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: none;
  }
  /* ---- §I4: hoja del botón crear (3 opciones) y popup de creación ---- */
  .sheet{
    position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 30; display: none;
    align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; background: rgba(20,23,15,.42);
  }
  .sheet.open{ display: flex; }
  .sheet .panel{
    width: 100%; max-width: 430px; background: var(--paper-raised);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong); border-radius: 14px 14px 0 0;
    padding: 14px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;
    max-height: 88vh; overflow-y: auto;
  }
  .sheet h3{
    margin: 0 0 2px; font-family: "Fraunces", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
  }
  .sheet h3 .kbd{ font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted); }
  .sheet .opt{
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 2px; text-align: left;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong); background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink);
    border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 12px;
  }
  .sheet .opt strong{ font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; }
  .sheet .opt small{ color: var(--muted); font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.4; }
  .form-row{ display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
  .form-row label{ font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); }
  .form-row input, .form-row select, .form-row textarea{
    background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong);
    border-radius: 8px; padding: 7px 9px; font-size: 13px; width: 100%; font-family: inherit;
  }
  .form-row textarea{ resize: vertical; min-height: 48px; }
  .palette{ display: flex; gap: 5px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .palette button{ width: 20px; height: 20px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid transparent; padding: 0; }
  .palette button[aria-pressed="true"]{ border-color: var(--ink); }
  .sheet .actions{ display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 8px; margin-top: 2px; }
  .sheet .note{ font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.45; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="hud">
  <span class="pill streak">🔥 12</span>
  <span class="pill currency">◈ 240</span>
  <span class="spacer"></span>
  <button class="hud-tool" id="antiToggle" aria-pressed="false" title="Mostrar antimetas (v3 §E8)">✦ Antimetas</button>
  <button class="hud-tool" id="resetView" title="Restablecer orden circular por creación (v3 §E4)">⟲ Restablecer</button>
  <button class="icon-btn" title="Decorativo por ahora (v3 §F2)">⚙</button>
  <button class="icon-btn" title="Decorativo por ahora (v3 §F2)">👥</button>
</div>
<button class="go-back hud-tool" id="goBack" type="button">← Volver a la galaxia</button>

<!-- §I8: título de la vista de supermeta: nombre (editable con lápiz) + % + config -->
<div class="focus-head" id="focusHead">
  <span class="fname" id="fhName"></span>
  <span class="fpct" id="fhPct"></span>
  <button class="icon-mini" id="fhEdit" type="button" title="Renombrar esta supermeta">✎</button>
  <button class="icon-mini" id="fhConfig" type="button" title="Configuración de metas y supermetas (§I8/J4)">⚙</button>
  <input type="text" id="fhInput" maxlength="28" style="display:none">
  <button class="mini-btn" id="fhSaveName" type="button" style="display:none">Guardar</button>
</div>
<div id="stage"><svg id="links"></svg></div>
<button class="fab" id="fabCreate" title="Crear (hotkey) — §I4">+</button>

<!-- §I4: hoja del botón crear, con 3 opciones -->
<div class="sheet" id="menuSheet">
  <div class="panel">
    <h3>Crear <span class="kbd">hotkey</span></h3>
    <button class="opt" id="optGoal" type="button">
      <strong>Crear supermeta / meta</strong>
      <small>Abre aquí mismo el popup: asociar a calendario, color (default: el del calendario), tareas y subtareas, plazo.</small>
    </button>
    <button class="opt" id="optBlock" type="button">
      <strong>Iniciar bloque</strong>
      <small>Redirección al cronómetro.</small>
    </button>
    <button class="opt" id="optEvent" type="button">
      <strong>Crear evento de calendario</strong>
      <small>Redirección al panel de creación de evento del calendario.</small>
    </button>
    <div class="actions"><button class="mini-btn" id="menuClose" type="button">Cerrar</button></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- §I4 + §I6 + §J1–J3: popup de creación de supermeta / meta -->
<div class="sheet" id="createSheet">
  <div class="panel">
    <h3 id="createTitle">Crear supermeta</h3>

    <!-- §I4.1: el popup permite crear supermeta o meta -->
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>¿Qué querés crear?</label>
      <div style="display:flex; gap:6px">
        <button class="mini-btn" id="modeSuper" aria-pressed="true" type="button">Supermeta</button>
        <button class="mini-btn" id="modeGoal" aria-pressed="false" type="button">Meta</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="superFields">
      <div class="form-row">
        <label>Nombre de la supermeta</label>
        <input type="text" id="cSuperName" maxlength="28" placeholder="p. ej. Título">
      </div>
      <div class="form-row">
        <label>¿Pertenece a un calendario existente? (§J1)</label>
        <select id="cSuperCal"></select>
      </div>
      <div class="form-row">
        <label>Color de la supermeta (default: el del calendario)</label>
        <div class="palette" id="cSuperPalette"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-row">
        <label>Plazo de cumplimiento — máx. 1 año, mín. 1 segundo (§I6)</label>
        <input type="datetime-local" id="cSuperDeadline">
      </div>
      <div class="form-row">
        <label>¿Es antimeta? (sin puntaje, solo eventos atemporales · v3 §A7)</label>
        <button class="mini-btn" id="cSuperAnti" aria-pressed="false" type="button" style="align-self:flex-start">No</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-row" id="goalFields">
      <label>Nombre de la meta</label>
      <input type="text" id="cGoalName" maxlength="40" placeholder="p. ej. Ramo 1">
      <label style="margin-top:6px">Supermeta a la que pertenece (§J3)</label>
      <select id="cGoalSuper"></select>
      <label style="margin-top:6px">Color de la meta (color del bloque en el calendario · §K3)</label>
      <div class="palette" id="cGoalPalette"></div>
      <label style="margin-top:6px">Plazo de cumplimiento (§I6)</label>
      <input type="datetime-local" id="cGoalDeadline">
      <label style="margin-top:6px">Tareas y subtareas (una por línea — base del % · §I7)</label>
      <textarea id="cGoalTasks" placeholder="Leer capítulo 1&#10;Ejercicios 1–10"></textarea>
    </div>

    <p class="note" id="createNote"></p>
    <div class="actions">
      <button class="mini-btn" id="createCancel" type="button">Cancelar</button>
      <button class="mini-btn" id="createSave" type="button">Crear</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<p class="hint-line">Arrastrá una supermeta para reordenarla — al soltar, la constelación se acomoda sola (v3 §E5). Clic en un planeta para verlo en foco (v3 §E6).</p>
<script>
(function(){
  var POS_KEY = "productvt-galaxia-pos-v2";
  var ORBIT_KEY = "productvt-galaxia-orbita-v1";
  var stage = document.getElementById("stage");
  var svg = document.getElementById("links");

  // ---- datos: supermetas y metas (misma fuente localStorage que Configuración) ----
  function loadSupermetas(){
    try{
      var raw = localStorage.getItem("productvt-supermetas-v1");
      if(raw){
        var parsed = JSON.parse(raw);
        if(parsed.length) return parsed.map(function(s, i){
          return {
            id: s.id || ("sg" + i),
            name: s.name,
            color: s.color || "#3A6B54",
            anti: !!s.anti,
            order: i,
            deadline: s.deadline || null,
            calendarId: s.calendarId || null,
            metas: (s.goals || []).map(function(g, j){
              if(typeof g === "string") g = { name: g };
              return {
                id: g.id || (s.id + ":" + j),
                name: g.name,
                color: g.color || s.color || "#3A6B54",
                deadline: g.deadline || null,
                tareas: (g.tareas || []).map(function(t){
                  return { name: (typeof t === "string" ? t : t.name), done: !!t.done };
                })
              };
            })
          };
        });
      }
    }catch(e){}
    return [
      { id: "titulo", name: "Título", color: "#3A6B54", anti: false, order: 0,
        deadline: null, calendarId: "cap-uni", metas: [
        { id: "t1", name: "Ramo 1", color: "#3A6B54", deadline: null, tareas: [ { name: "Leer capítulo 1", done: true }, { name: "Ejercicios 1–10", done: false }, { name: "Control 1", done: false } ] },
        { id: "t2", name: "Proyecto", color: "#2E7B84", deadline: null, tareas: [ { name: "Escribir informe", done: false } ] },
        { id: "t3", name: "Ayudantía", color: "#B9812E", deadline: null, tareas: [ { name: "Preparar guía", done: true } ] } ] },
      { id: "tesis", name: "Tesis", color: "#4E6E8E", anti: false, order: 1,
        deadline: null, calendarId: null, metas: [
        { id: "z1", name: "Capítulo 2", color: "#8C5A7A", deadline: null, tareas: [ { name: "Borrador", done: false }, { name: "Revisión", done: false } ] },
        { id: "z2", name: "Estado del arte", color: "#6B8F71", deadline: null, tareas: [ { name: "Buscar papers", done: true } ] } ] },
      { id: "idiomas", name: "Idiomas", color: "#A85C6B", anti: false, order: 2,
        deadline: null, calendarId: null, metas: [
        { id: "i1", name: "Japonés N4", color: "#C0672B", deadline: null, tareas: [ { name: "Kana", done: true } ] },
        { id: "i2", name: "Inglés C1", color: "#4A6FA5", deadline: null, tareas: [ { name: "Speaking", done: false } ] },
        { id: "i3", name: "Práctica oral", color: "#8C5A7A", deadline: null, tareas: [ { name: "Grabarse", done: false } ] } ] },
      { id: "salud", name: "Salud", color: "#6B8F71", anti: false, order: 3,
        deadline: null, calendarId: null, metas: [
        { id: "s1", name: "Gimnasio", color: "#3A6B54", deadline: null, tareas: [ { name: "3 sesiones", done: true } ] },
        { id: "s2", name: "Sueño 8h", color: "#4E6E8E", deadline: null, tareas: [ { name: "Rutina", done: false } ] } ] },
      { id: "antimeta", name: "Antimeta", color: "#9C4A3A", anti: true, order: 4,
        deadline: null, calendarId: null, metas: [] }
    ];
  }
  function goalPct(g){
    if(!g.tareas || !g.tareas.length) return 0;
    return Math.round(g.tareas.filter(function(t){ return t.done; }).length / g.tareas.length * 100);
  }
  function superPct(p){
    var all = [];
    p.metas.forEach(function(m){ all = all.concat(m.tareas || []); });
    if(!all.length) return 0;
    return Math.round(all.filter(function(t){ return t.done; }).length / all.length * 100);
  }
  // §I1: las lunas se orientan hacia abajo de la supermeta, manteniendo equidistancia
  function moonAngle(p, m){
    var n = p.metas.length;
    if(n <= 1) return 90;
    var spread = Math.min(140, n * 36);
    var step = spread / (n - 1);
    var idx = p.metas.indexOf(m);
    return 90 - spread / 2 + step * idx;
  }
  var planets = loadSupermetas();
  planets.forEach(function(p, i){ if(p.order === undefined) p.order = i; });

  function loadJSON(key, fallback){ try{ var raw = localStorage.getItem(key); return raw ? JSON.parse(raw) : fallback; }catch(e){ return fallback; } }
  function saveJSON(key, val){ try{ localStorage.setItem(key, JSON.stringify(val)); }catch(e){} }
  var angles = loadJSON(POS_KEY, {});   // { id: grados } — posición coordinada persistida (§E7)
  var orbits = loadJSON(ORBIT_KEY, {}); // { metaId: grados } — fase orbital persistida (§E7)
  var showAnti = false, focusId = null, draggingId = null, animating = false;

  function visiblePlanets(){
    return planets.filter(function(p){ return showAnti || !p.anti; });
  }
  function planetSize(p){
    if(focusId === p.id) return Math.min(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight) * 0.5; // §E6: mitad de pantalla
    if(p.anti) return 22; // §E8: bien pequeñas
    return 62;             // §E3: proporción considerable planeta:meta
  }
  // §I3: en la vista de supermeta las lunas orbitan pegadas al borde del planeta
  function moonRadius(p, m){
    var size = planetSize(p);
    if(focusId === p.id) return size / 2 + (m.id.length % 3) * 8 + 10;
    return 52 + (m.id.length % 3) * 9;
  }
  function layoutAngles(){
    var vis = visiblePlanets();
    var n = vis.length;
    var map = {};
    vis.forEach(function(p, k){
      var slot = -90 + (360 / n) * k; // §E4: orden de creación, sentido horario
      map[p.id] = (!justReset && angles[p.id] !== undefined) ? angles[p.id] : slot;
    });
    return map;
  }
  var justReset = false;
  function refreshOrbits(){
    planets.forEach(function(p){
      p.metas.forEach(function(m){
        if(orbits[m.id] === undefined || justReset) orbits[m.id] = moonAngle(p, m);
      });
    });
  }

  // ---- §I2: sin teletransportes — cada planeta/luna tiene una posición animada que
  // se interpola suavemente hacia su posición objetivo (reordenamiento y órbitas fluidas) ----
  function ensureDom(){
    if(!stage.querySelector("svg")) stage.innerHTML = '<svg id="links"></svg>';
    var seen = {};
    visiblePlanets().forEach(function(p){
      seen[p.id] = true;
      var el = stage.querySelector('[data-planet="'+p.id+'"]');
      if(!el){
        el = document.createElement("div");
        el.className = "planet" + (p.anti ? " anti" : "");
        el.setAttribute("data-planet", p.id);
        el.innerHTML = '<span class="pl-label">' + p.name + '</span>';
        el.addEventListener("pointerdown", function(ev){ startPlanetDrag(el, ev); });
        stage.appendChild(el);
      }
      el.classList.toggle("anti", !!p.anti);
      el.querySelector(".pl-label").textContent = p.name;
      el.style.background = p.color;
      p.metas.forEach(function(m){
        seen["m:" + m.id] = true;
        var mo = stage.querySelector('[data-moon="'+m.id+'"]');
        if(!mo){
          mo = document.createElement("div");
          mo.className = "moon";
          mo.setAttribute("data-moon", m.id);
          mo.innerHTML = '<span class="mn-label">' + m.name + '</span>';
          stage.appendChild(mo);
        }
        mo.querySelector(".mn-label").textContent = focusId === p.id
          ? m.name + " · " + goalPct(m) + "%"   // §I7: % de tareas cumplidas por meta
          : m.name;
        mo.style.background = m.color || p.color;
      });
    });
    Array.prototype.slice.call(stage.querySelectorAll("[data-planet],[data-moon]")).forEach(function(el){
      var key = el.dataset.planet ? el.dataset.planet : ("m:" + el.dataset.moon);
      if(!seen[key]) el.remove();
    });
  }

  function render(){
    ensureDom();
    var w = window.innerWidth, h = window.innerHeight;
    var cx = w / 2, cy = h / 2 + 14;
    var R = Math.min(w, h) * (focusId ? 0 : 0.36);
    var amap = layoutAngles();
    refreshOrbits();
    planets.forEach(function(p){
      if(!showAnti && p.anti) return;
      var px, py;
      if(focusId === p.id){ px = cx; py = cy; }
      else if(focusId){ return; } // §E6: en foco no se ven las demás supermetas
      else {
        var a = amap[p.id] * Math.PI / 180;
        px = cx + R * Math.cos(a); py = cy + R * Math.sin(a);
      }
      p._x = px; p._y = py;                 // objetivo
      if(p.ax === undefined){ p.ax = px; p.ay = py; } // arranque sin animación
    });
  }

  // ---- posiciones animadas: interpola hacia el objetivo (fluidez §I2) ----
  function shortestDelta(from, to){
    var d = ((to - from) % 360 + 540) % 360 - 180;
    return d;
  }
  function tick(){
    var amap = layoutAngles();
    planets.forEach(function(p){
      if(!showAnti && p.anti) return;
      if(focusId && focusId !== p.id) return;
      if(p._x === undefined) return;
      if(draggingId !== p.id){
        p.ax += (p._x - p.ax) * 0.16;
        p.ay += (p._y - p.ay) * 0.16;
      }
      var size = planetSize(p);
      var el = stage.querySelector('[data-planet="'+p.id+'"]');
      if(el){
        el.style.width = size + "px"; el.style.height = size + "px";
        el.style.left = (p.ax - size / 2) + "px";
        el.style.top = (p.ay - size / 2) + "px";
      }
      p.metas.forEach(function(m){
        var target;
        if(focusId === p.id){
          // §I3: en la vista de supermeta las lunas orbitan pegadas al borde del gran
          // planeta, como asteroides/lunas — vuelta completa, no un abanico flotante.
          var idxF = p.metas.indexOf(m);
          var speed = 0.16 + idxF * 0.012;
          orbits[m.id] = ((orbits[m.id] === undefined ? moonAngle(p, m) : orbits[m.id]) + speed) % 360;
          target = orbits[m.id];
        } else {
          // §I1 base hacia abajo y equidistante; §I5 deriva orbital leve alrededor de esa base
          var base = orbits[m.id] === undefined ? moonAngle(p, m) : orbits[m.id];
          var idx = p.metas.indexOf(m);
          var drift = 5 * Math.sin(performance.now() / 2600 + idx * 1.3);
          target = base + drift;
        }
        if(m._a === undefined) m._a = target;
        m._a += shortestDelta(m._a, target) * 0.2;
        var rOv = moonRadius(p, m);
        var rad = m._a * Math.PI / 180;
        m._x = p.ax + rOv * Math.cos(rad);
        m._y = p.ay + rOv * Math.sin(rad);
        var mo = stage.querySelector('[data-moon="'+m.id+'"]');
        if(mo){
          var ms = focusId === p.id ? 16 : 9; // §I3: en foco las lunas se ven con mayor resolución
          mo.style.width = ms + "px"; mo.style.height = ms + "px";
          mo.style.left = (m._x - ms / 2) + "px";
          mo.style.top = (m._y - ms / 2) + "px";
        }
      });
    });
    drawLines();
  }

  function drawLines(){
    var s = stage.querySelector("svg");
    if(!s) return;
    var out = "";
    planets.forEach(function(p){
      if(focusId && focusId !== p.id) return;
      if(p.ax === undefined) return;
      p.metas.forEach(function(m){
        if(m._x === undefined) return;
        out += '<line x1="'+p.ax+'" y1="'+p.ay+'" x2="'+m._x+'" y2="'+m._y+'"></line>';
      });
    });
    s.innerHTML = out;
  }

  // ---- §E5: arrastre libre (posiciones anómalas) + empuje a las demás; al soltar,
  // la supermeta queda en el slot circular coordinado más cercano y reordena a las demás ----
  function startPlanetDrag(el, ev){
    if(focusId) return;
    var p = planets.filter(function(x){ return x.id === el.dataset.planet; })[0];
    if(!p) return;
    ev.preventDefault();
    var moved = false;
    var startX = ev.clientX, startY = ev.clientY;
    var rect = el.getBoundingClientRect();
    var offX = ev.clientX - rect.left - rect.width / 2;
    var offY = ev.clientY - rect.top - rect.height / 2;
    var size = planetSize(p);
    draggingId = p.id;
    el.classList.add("dragging");
    function onMove(e2){
      var dx = e2.clientX - startX, dy = e2.clientY - startY;
      if(Math.abs(dx) > 4 || Math.abs(dy) > 4) moved = true;
      p._x = e2.clientX - offX; p._y = e2.clientY - offY;
      p.ax = p._x; p.ay = p._y; // el arrastrado sigue al puntero sin lag
      el.style.left = (p.ax - size / 2) + "px";
      el.style.top = (p.ay - size / 2) + "px";
      planets.forEach(function(o){ // empuje suave tipo graph view mientras se arrastra
        if(o === p || o.ax === undefined) return;
        var vx = o.ax - p.ax, vy = o.ay - p.ay;
        var d = Math.sqrt(vx * vx + vy * vy) || 1;
        if(d < 150){
          var push = (150 - d) / 150 * 12;
          o._x = o.ax + vx / d * push; o._y = o.ay + vy / d * push;
        }
      });
      drawLines();
    }
    function onUp(){
      document.removeEventListener("pointermove", onMove);
      document.removeEventListener("pointerup", onUp);
      el.classList.remove("dragging");
      draggingId = null;
      if(!moved){ enterFocus(p.id); return; } // §E6: clic simple → foco
      var cx = window.innerWidth / 2, cy = window.innerHeight / 2 + 14;
      var ang = Math.atan2(p.ay - cy, p.ax - cx) * 180 / Math.PI;
      var vis = visiblePlanets().slice().sort(function(a, b){ return a.order - b.order; });
      var n = vis.length;
      var k = Math.round((ang + 90) / (360 / n));
      k = ((k % n) + n) % n; // slot circular más cercano al punto de soltado
      var cur = vis.map(function(x){ return x.id; }).indexOf(p.id);
      vis.splice(cur, 1);
      vis.splice(k, 0, p);
      vis.forEach(function(x, i){
        var real = planets.filter(function(q){ return q.id === x.id; })[0];
        real.order = i;
        angles[x.id] = -90 + (360 / n) * i; // nueva posición coordinada (§E5)
      });
      saveJSON(POS_KEY, angles); // §E7: persiste salvo reseteo
      render(); // §I2: los objetivos cambian y tick() los interpola → animación fluida, sin teletransporte
    }
    document.addEventListener("pointermove", onMove);
    document.addEventListener("pointerup", onUp);
  }

  // ---- §E6: vista de foco a pantalla completa + §I8: título con nombre, % y config ----
  function enterFocus(id){
    focusId = id;
    document.body.classList.add("focus");
    var p = planets.filter(function(x){ return x.id === id; })[0];
    if(p){
      document.getElementById("fhName").textContent = p.name;
      document.getElementById("fhPct").textContent = superPct(p) + "%";
    }
    render(); // §I3: las lunas pasan a orbitar pegadas al borde del planeta grande
  }
  function exitFocus(){
    focusId = null;
    document.body.classList.remove("focus");
    render();
  }
  document.getElementById("goBack").addEventListener("click", exitFocus);
  stage.addEventListener("click", function(ev){
    if(!focusId) return;
    if(ev.target === stage || ev.target.tagName === "svg" || ev.target.tagName === "line") exitFocus();
  });
  // §I8: renombrar la supermeta desde la cabecera
  document.getElementById("fhEdit").addEventListener("click", function(){
    var p = planets.filter(function(x){ return x.id === focusId; })[0];
    if(!p) return;
    var inp = document.getElementById("fhInput");
    inp.value = p.name;
    inp.style.display = "inline-block";
    document.getElementById("fhSaveName").style.display = "inline-block";
    document.getElementById("fhName").style.display = "none";
    inp.focus();
  });
  document.getElementById("fhSaveName").addEventListener("click", function(){
    var p = planets.filter(function(x){ return x.id === focusId; })[0];
    var v = document.getElementById("fhInput").value.trim();
    if(p && v){
      p.name = v;
      document.getElementById("fhName").textContent = v;
      persistSupermetas();
      render();
    }
    document.getElementById("fhInput").style.display = "none";
    this.style.display = "none";
    document.getElementById("fhName").style.display = "";
  });
  document.getElementById("fhConfig").addEventListener("click", function(){
    location.href = "configuracion.html"; // §I8/J4: redirige al panel de gestión pulido
  });
  function persistSupermetas(){
    try{
      var raw = localStorage.getItem("productvt-supermetas-v1");
      var arr = raw ? JSON.parse(raw) : null;
      if(!arr || !arr.length) return;
      arr.forEach(function(s){
        var p = planets.filter(function(x){ return x.name === s.name || x.id === s.id; })[0];
        if(p) s.name = p.name;
      });
      localStorage.setItem("productvt-supermetas-v1", JSON.stringify(arr));
    }catch(e){}
  }

  // ---- §E8: antimetas ocultas por defecto; botón las muestra bien pequeñas ----
  document.getElementById("antiToggle").addEventListener("click", function(){
    showAnti = !showAnti;
    this.setAttribute("aria-pressed", String(showAnti));
    render();
  });

  // ---- §E4/§I1: restablecer al orden circular por creación, sentido horario ----
  document.getElementById("resetView").addEventListener("click", function(){
    var wasFocus = !!focusId;
    angles = {}; orbits = {};
    planets.forEach(function(p, i){
      p.order = i;
      p.ax = undefined; // re-arranque limpio, la animación se encarga
    });
    justReset = true;
    refreshOrbits();
    justReset = false;
    saveJSON(POS_KEY, angles); saveJSON(ORBIT_KEY, orbits);
    if(wasFocus) exitFocus(); else render();
  });

  // ---- §I4: el botón crear (hotkey) abre un popup con 3 opciones ----
  var hint = document.querySelector(".hint-line");
  var hintOriginal = hint.textContent;
  function openSheet(el){ el.classList.add("open"); }
  function closeSheet(el){ el.classList.remove("open"); }
  var menuSheet = document.getElementById("menuSheet");
  var createSheet = document.getElementById("createSheet");
  document.getElementById("fabCreate").addEventListener("click", function(){ openSheet(menuSheet); });
  document.getElementById("menuClose").addEventListener("click", function(){ closeSheet(menuSheet); });
  menuSheet.addEventListener("click", function(ev){ if(ev.target === menuSheet) closeSheet(menuSheet); });
  createSheet.addEventListener("click", function(ev){ if(ev.target === createSheet) closeSheet(createSheet); });
  document.getElementById("optBlock").addEventListener("click", function(){
    location.href = "cronometro.html"; // redirección al cronómetro (§I4.2)
  });
  document.getElementById("optEvent").addEventListener("click", function(){
    location.href = "calendario.html#nuevo-evento"; // redirección al panel de evento del calendario (§I4.3)
  });
  document.getElementById("optGoal").addEventListener("click", function(){
    closeSheet(menuSheet); openCreate("super");
  });
  // §I4.1: alternar entre crear supermeta (obliga a su primera meta) o meta suelta
  function syncModeButtons(){
    var isSuper = createMode === "super";
    document.getElementById("modeSuper").setAttribute("aria-pressed", String(isSuper));
    document.getElementById("modeGoal").setAttribute("aria-pressed", String(!isSuper));
    document.getElementById("superFields").style.display = isSuper ? "" : "none";
    document.getElementById("cGoalSuper").disabled = isSuper;
    document.getElementById("createTitle").textContent = isSuper ? "Crear supermeta" : "Crear meta";
    document.getElementById("createNote").textContent = isSuper
      ? "Al crear la supermeta se abre altiro la creación de su primera meta (§J3). El color baja del calendario si la asociás."
      : "Elegí la supermeta a la que pertenece; desde el lápiz del panel de gestión podés moverla de supermeta (§J7).";
  }
  document.getElementById("modeSuper").addEventListener("click", function(){ createMode = "super"; syncModeButtons(); });
  document.getElementById("modeGoal").addEventListener("click", function(){ createMode = "meta"; fillSupers(); syncModeButtons(); document.getElementById("cGoalName").focus(); });

  // ---- §I4/§I6/§J1–J3: creación de supermetas y metas ----
  var PALETTE = ["#3A6B54","#4E6E8E","#A85C6B","#6B8F71","#B9812E","#2E7B84","#8C5A7A","#C0672B","#4A6FA5","#9C4A3A"];
  var CAL_DEFAULT = [ { id: "cap-uni", name: "Cap. Universitario", color: "#2E7B84" },
                      { id: "personal", name: "Personal", color: "#6B8F71" } ];
  // v3 §K1/§K2: los calendarios se gestionan aparte; misma clave que calendario.html y
  // configuracion.html ("productvt-capas-v1", allí llamados "calendarios").
  function loadCals(){
    var raw = loadJSON("productvt-capas-v1", null);
    var arr = (raw && raw.length) ? raw : CAL_DEFAULT;
    return arr.map(function(c){ return { id: c.id, name: c.name, color: c.color }; });
  }
  var cals = loadCals();
  var createMode = null, cSuperColor = cals[0].color, cGoalColor = PALETTE[0], cAnti = false;
  function wirePalette(el, get, set){
    el.innerHTML = "";
    PALETTE.forEach(function(col){
      var b = document.createElement("button");
      b.type = "button"; b.style.background = col;
      b.setAttribute("aria-pressed", String(col === get()));
      b.addEventListener("click", function(){
        set(col);
        Array.prototype.slice.call(el.children).forEach(function(x){ x.setAttribute("aria-pressed", String(x === b)); });
      });
      el.appendChild(b);
    });
  }
  function fillCals(){
    var sel = document.getElementById("cSuperCal");
    sel.innerHTML = "";
    var none = document.createElement("option");
    none.value = ""; none.textContent = "No — se crea un calendario propio con su nombre";
    sel.appendChild(none);
    cals.forEach(function(c){
      var o = document.createElement("option");
      o.value = c.id; o.textContent = "Sí — " + c.name;
      sel.appendChild(o);
    });
  }
  function fillSupers(){
    var sel = document.getElementById("cGoalSuper");
    sel.innerHTML = "";
    var valid = planets.filter(function(p){ return !p.anti; });
    valid.forEach(function(p){
      var o = document.createElement("option");
      o.value = p.id; o.textContent = p.name;
      sel.appendChild(o);
    });
    if(!valid.length){
      var o = document.createElement("option");
      o.value = ""; o.textContent = "Sin supermetas (crea una primero)";
      sel.appendChild(o);
    }
  }
function openCreate(mode){
    createMode = mode;
    document.getElementById("createTitle").textContent =
      mode === "super" ? "Crear supermeta" : "Crear meta";
    // §J3: al crear supermeta se obliga a crearle una meta; al crear meta se elige su supermeta
    document.getElementById("superFields").style.display = mode === "super" ? "" : "none";
    document.getElementById("goalFields").style.display = "";
    document.getElementById("cGoalSuper").disabled = mode === "super";
    document.getElementById("createNote").textContent = mode === "super"
      ? "Al crear la supermeta se abre altiro la creación de su primera meta (§J3). El color baja del calendario si la asociás."
      : "La meta puede elegir su supermeta; desde el lápiz del panel de gestión podés moverla de supermeta (§J7).";
    fillCals(); fillSupers();
    document.getElementById("cSuperName").value = "";
    document.getElementById("cSuperDeadline").value = "";
    document.getElementById("cGoalDeadline").value = "";
    document.getElementById("cGoalName").value = "";
    document.getElementById("cGoalTasks").value = "";
    cAnti = false;
    document.getElementById("cSuperAnti").textContent = "No";
    document.getElementById("cSuperAnti").setAttribute("aria-pressed", "false");
    cGoalColor = PALETTE[0];
    cSuperColor = cals[0].color;
    wirePalette(document.getElementById("cSuperPalette"), function(){ return cSuperColor; }, function(c){ cSuperColor = c; });
    wirePalette(document.getElementById("cGoalPalette"), function(){ return cGoalColor; }, function(c){ cGoalColor = c; });
    syncModeButtons();
    openSheet(createSheet);
  }
  document.getElementById("cSuperCal").addEventListener("change", function(){
    var c = cals.filter(function(x){ return x.id === this.value; })[0];
    if(c){
      cSuperColor = c.color;
      wirePalette(document.getElementById("cSuperPalette"), function(){ return cSuperColor; }, function(x){ cSuperColor = x; });
    }
  });
  document.getElementById("cSuperAnti").addEventListener("click", function(){
    cAnti = !cAnti;
    this.textContent = cAnti ? "Sí" : "No";
    this.setAttribute("aria-pressed", String(cAnti));
  });
  // §I6: plazo máximo 1 año, mínimo 1 segundo
  function toLocalInput(ms){
    var d = new Date(ms);
    function p(n){ return (n < 10 ? "0" : "") + n; }
    return d.getFullYear() + "-" + p(d.getMonth() + 1) + "-" + p(d.getDate()) + "T" + p(d.getHours()) + ":" + p(d.getMinutes());
  }
  function clampTime(v, min, max){
    var t = v ? new Date(v).getTime() : (min + 30 * 24 * 3600 * 1000);
    if(isNaN(t)) t = min + 30 * 24 * 3600 * 1000;
    if(t < min + 1000) t = min + 1000;   // mínimo 1 segundo
    if(t > min + max) t = min + max;     // máximo 1 año
    return t;
  }
  document.getElementById("createCancel").addEventListener("click", function(){ closeSheet(createSheet); });
  document.getElementById("createSave").addEventListener("click", function(){
    var ONE_YEAR = 365 * 24 * 3600 * 1000, now = Date.now();
    var name = document.getElementById("cGoalName").value.trim();
    var superSel = document.getElementById("cGoalSuper");
    var superTarget = planets.filter(function(p){ return p.id === superSel.value; })[0];
    if(!name){ document.getElementById("cGoalName").focus(); return; }
    if(createMode === "super"){
      var sName = document.getElementById("cSuperName").value.trim();
      if(!sName){ document.getElementById("cSuperName").focus(); return; }
      var sup = {
        id: "sg" + now, name: sName, color: cSuperColor, anti: cAnti,
        order: planets.length, deadline: clampTime(document.getElementById("cSuperDeadline").value, now, ONE_YEAR),
        calendarId: document.getElementById("cSuperCal").value || null, metas: []
      };
      planets.push(sup);
      superTarget = sup; // §J3: la primera meta pertenece a esta supermeta
      angles[sup.id] = -90 + (360 / Math.max(1, visiblePlanets().length)) * (visiblePlanets().length - 1);
    }
    if(!superTarget){ fillSupers(); return; }
    superTarget.metas.push({
      id: "g" + now + "-" + superTarget.metas.length,
      name: name, color: cGoalColor,
      deadline: clampTime(document.getElementById("cGoalDeadline").value, now, ONE_YEAR),
      tareas: document.getElementById("cGoalTasks").value.split("\n")
        .map(function(s){ return s.trim(); }).filter(Boolean)
        .map(function(n){ return { name: n, done: false }; })
    });
    savePlanets();
    saveJSON(POS_KEY, angles);
    closeSheet(createSheet);
    render();
    hint.textContent = "“" + name + "” quedó dentro de “" + superTarget.name + "” — los bloques del cronómetro se registran ahí (§D1).";
    setTimeout(function(){ hint.textContent = hintOriginal; }, 3600);
  });
  function savePlanets(){
    try{
      localStorage.setItem("productvt-supermetas-v1", JSON.stringify(planets.map(function(p){
        return { id: p.id, name: p.name, color: p.color, anti: p.anti, deadline: p.deadline || null,
                 calendarId: p.calendarId || null,
                 goals: p.metas.map(function(m){
                   return { id: m.id, name: m.name, color: m.color, deadline: m.deadline || null,
                            tareas: (m.tareas || []).map(function(t){ return { name: t.name, done: !!t.done }; }) };
                 }) };
      })));
    }catch(e){}
  }

  // ---- §I5/§I2: bucle de animación (órbita leve y reordenamientos fluidos) ----
  var lastSave = 0;
  function frame(ts){
    tick();
    if(ts - lastSave > 4000){ lastSave = ts; saveJSON(ORBIT_KEY, orbits); }
    requestAnimationFrame(frame);
  }
  requestAnimationFrame(frame);

  window.addEventListener("resize", render);
  window.addEventListener("beforeunload", function(){ saveJSON(ORBIT_KEY, orbits); savePlanets(); });
  render();
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
</file>

<file path="01-mockups/mobile/calendario.html">
<title>Almanaque por Capas</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --paper: #EFEDE5; --paper-raised: #FAF9F3; --ink: #20241E; --muted: #6E7368;
    --accent: #3A6B54; --accent-ink: #F3F7F1; --accent-soft: #DCE6DC;
    --rule: #D5D1C1; --rule-strong: #B9B4A0; --danger: #9C4A3A; --focus: #3A6B54;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){
    :root:not([data-theme="light"]){
      --paper: #14170F; --paper-raised: #1B1F16; --ink: #E9E7DC; --muted: #949A88;
      --accent: #7BB596; --accent-ink: #10241A; --accent-soft: #223429;
      --rule: #2B3225; --rule-strong: #3C4433; --danger: #D08871; --focus: #7BB596;
    }
  }
  :root[data-theme="dark"]{
    --paper: #14170F; --paper-raised: #1B1F16; --ink: #E9E7DC; --muted: #949A88;
    --accent: #7BB596; --accent-ink: #10241A; --accent-soft: #223429;
    --rule: #2B3225; --rule-strong: #3C4433; --danger: #D08871; --focus: #7BB596;
  }
  *{ box-sizing: border-box; }
  html,body{ height: 100%; }
  body{ background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); font-family: "Archivo", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif; }
  button, select{ font: inherit; }

  .app{ display: grid; grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr; min-height: 100vh; max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; }
  @media (max-width: 760px){ .app{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  /* ---- barra lateral de capas (desktop) / cajón (mobile) ---- */
  .layers-panel{
    border-right: 1px solid var(--rule); padding: 18px 14px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px){
    .layers-panel{
      position: fixed; inset: 0 20% 0 0; z-index: 40; background: var(--paper); border-right: 1px solid var(--rule-strong);
      transform: translateX(-105%); transition: transform .25s ease; overflow-y: auto;
    }
    .layers-panel.open{ transform: translateX(0); box-shadow: 8px 0 24px rgba(0,0,0,.25); }
  }
  .layers-panel h2{ font-family: "Fraunces", Georgia, serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0; }
  .layer-row{ display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 13px; }
  .layer-group-header{ font-weight: 600; margin-top: 6px; }
  .layer-sub-row{ padding-left: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }
  .layer-sub-row .ldel{ font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace; font-size: 9.5px; }
  .assign-select{
    font-size: 10.5px; background: var(--paper-raised); color: var(--muted); border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong);
    border-radius: 5px; padding: 2px 4px;
  }
  .layer-row input[type="checkbox"]{ accent-color: var(--accent); width: 15px; height: 15px; flex: none; }
  .layer-row .swatch{ width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; flex: none; }
  .layer-row .lname{ flex: 1; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
  .layer-row .lkind{ font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace; font-size: 9.5px; color: var(--muted); }
  .layer-row .ldel{ background: none; border: none; color: var(--muted); cursor: pointer; font-size: 13px; }
  .layer-row .ldel:hover{ color: var(--danger); }
  .add-layer{
    display: flex; gap: 6px; margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .add-layer input[type="text"]{
    flex: 1; font-size: 12.5px; background: var(--paper-raised); color: var(--ink);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong); border-radius: 6px; padding: 6px 8px;
  }
  .add-layer input[type="color"]{ width: 30px; border: none; background: none; padding: 0; cursor: pointer; }
  .mini-btn{
    font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace; font-size: 11.5px; background: var(--paper-raised); color: var(--ink);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong); border-radius: 6px; padding: 6px 9px; cursor: pointer;
  }
  .closeLayersBtn{ display: none; }
  @media (max-width: 760px){ .closeLayersBtn{ display: inline-block; align-self: flex-end; } }

  .backdrop{ position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,.3); z-index: 35; display: none; }
  .backdrop.show{ display: block; }

  /* ---- barra superior: navegación, vistas, hoy ---- */
  .main{ padding: 12px 16px 24px; min-width: 0; }
  .search-input{
    font-size: 12.5px; background: var(--paper-raised); color: var(--ink);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong); border-radius: 7px; padding: 6px 10px; width: 140px;
  }
  .search-hit{ outline: 2px solid var(--danger); outline-offset: -1px; }
  /* ---- enmienda v3 §B4: día actual destacado ---- */
  .month-day.today{ box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px var(--accent); }
  .month-day.today .num{ color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; }
  .tl-day-head.today{ color: var(--accent); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px var(--accent); }
  .tl-day-head .hoy{
    font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .06em;
    color: var(--accent-ink); background: var(--accent); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1px 6px; vertical-align: 1px;
  }
  /* ---- enmienda v3 §B3: evento arrastrable ---- */
  .tl-event{ cursor: grab; touch-action: none; user-select: none; -webkit-user-select: none; }
  .tl-event.dragging{ opacity: .85; cursor: grabbing; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.25); z-index: 5; }
  .tl-day-col.drag-over{ background: var(--accent-soft); }
  .topbar{ display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .layersToggleBtn{ display: none; }
  @media (max-width: 760px){ .layersToggleBtn{ display: inline-flex; } }
  .icon-btn{
    width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong); background: var(--paper-raised);
    color: var(--ink); cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px;
  }
  .period-label{ font-family: "Fraunces", Georgia, serif; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 500; text-transform: capitalize; margin-right: auto; }
  .view-switch{ display: flex; gap: 4px; border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong); border-radius: 8px; padding: 3px; }
  .view-switch button{
    background: none; border: none; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer;
    font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
  }
